NAME: known bug: a variable next to a plain reference
DESCRIPTION: characterization of current output (i-7d2612-9efd00); MOV x (Dir -1) copies the whole cell (.I) instead of x's value, see behtests/mixed_operand_field.beh
SRC:
(let (x 7)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 3))
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (DAT 0 0)
    (MOV x (Dir -1))
    (JMP 0) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $3     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #7     , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  MOV.I  $_LET1 , $-1    
  JMP    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     